  "body": "## Changelog\n* 9f95cd6e06de134c1d5274f0595a69b18190edc6  Issue #762 (#763)\n* eb6ac4cb889beabbfb2cb40841c1c07ff6adc25c fix(asp.net): correct the server side comment terminator (#772)\n* 300b452169dc4e2199f7d651910e7d3449f0b02e fix(php): correct the double quoted string delimiter (#759)\n* a1620695ce7a8700e3dd73c9c1b47b4470696ee5 fix: count Rust byte character literals (#764)\n* d96feb79278f82020f31286d2952937c053ce38c fix: normalise negative zero in report SVG coordinates (#767) (#768)\n* de6aac04440809ad6d53c055a6984edd27b5166a fix: resolve HEAD in git worktrees (#765) (#766)\n* 74aeb15421b5cc80d796b8092cf40452567897ed fix: write response body before returning from the handler (#761)\n* 4a2b4d3ff82de0a31193521eeef2c83b157244fd perf: count the kernel in half the time, and count it correctly (#771)\n* c651b07a7d3aa6e97a476380eef0f478a53719a3 prepare 4.1.0 release\n\n",
